gps_baseband : Logic only unwrapped core.
---------------------------------------

1.insert_edt_occ: This step inserts EDT and standard OCC at RTL using DFTSpec with design_id rtl1 and NO IJTAG
        run script: run_insert_edt_occ
        Log file : logfiles/run_insert_edt_occ.log

2.synthesis: This step performs synthesis of the entire gps_baseband
        Run script: run_dc_synthesis
        Log file : logfiles/run_dc_synthesis.log

3.scan_insertion: This step performs scan chain insertion and stitching using design_id gate
        run script: run_scan_insertion
        Log file : logfiles/run_scan_insertion.log

4.ATPG_patterns: This step performs ATPG pattern generation. The testbenches are stored inside patterns directory
        Scripts to use: run_stuck
                        run_transition
                        run_sims

       Log files: logfiles/run_stuck.log
                  logfiles/run_transition.log
                  logfiles/verilog.log_*

